 branches, consisting of 273 owned and 149 leased locations. The institution, initially known as ZB, National Association, officially adopted its current name, Zions Bancorporation, National Association, in September 2018.","description_en":"Headquartered in Salt Lake City, Utah, Zions Bancorporation, National Association is a long-standing financial institution, founded in 1873. Operating primarily across the western United States, it delivers a comprehensive suite of banking and financial services throughout Arizona, California, Colorado, Idaho, Nevada, New Mexico, Oregon, Texas, Utah, Washington, and Wyoming. The company's diverse offerings encompass corporate banking, commercial banking (with a particular emphasis on small and medium-sized businesses), and commercial real estate financing. It also extends municipal and public finance services, retail banking (including residential mortgages), trust services, wealth management and private client banking, and capital markets products. As of December 31, 2020, Zions Bancorporation maintained a network of 422 branches, consisting of 273 owned and 149 leased locations. The institution, initially known as ZB, National Association, officially adopted its current name, Zions Bancorporation, National Association, in September 2018.","description_zh":"Zions Bancorporation, National Association（美股代碼：ZION）為 Financial Services 領域之重要企業，專注於 Banks - Regional 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"One South Main Street","city":"Salt Lake City","state":"UT","zip":"84133-1109","country":"US","phone":"801 844 7637","full_address":"One South Main Street, Salt Lake City, UT 84133-1109, US","range_52w":"48.5-73.34","year_high":73.34,"year_low":48.5,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":48.5,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-10-01","name":"Lee Vivian S","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":398,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-01","name":"Huang 